  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> Institute of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS) has recently published the official notification for Hindi Officer Post Recruitment on the official website of IBPS. For which the details for IBPS Hindi Officer Recruitment 2025 has been provided on this page. Online applying process for IBPS Hindi Officer Recruitment 2025 has started from 01 July 2025. Candidates must check the complete details for IBPS Hindi Officer Recruitment 2025 which has given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Institute of Banking Personnel Selection (IBPS)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">IBPS Hindi Officer Online Form 2025</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Advertisement No.: IBPS/2025-26/04</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Starting Date :<strong>&nbsp;01 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date for Registration :<strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">15 July 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Fee Payment Last Date :<strong> 15 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>July / August 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>August 2025</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General, OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IBPS Hindi Officer Notification 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidate must have been born not earlier than 02.07.1995 and not later than 01.07.2002 (both dates inclusive)</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>23 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>30 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per IBPS Hindi Officer Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IBPS Hindi Officer 2025 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : NA Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Hindi Officer (On Regular Basis)</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">—</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>IBPS Hindi Officer Recruitment 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s degree from a recognized university in Hindi with English as a major or elective subject at Graduation. <strong>OR</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s degree from a recognized university in English with Hindi as major or elective subject at Graduation. <strong>OR</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s degree from a recognized university in any subject other than Hindi or English, with Hindi as a major or elective subject and English as medium of examination at degree level. <strong>OR</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Master’s degree from a recognized University in any subject other than Hindi or English with English as a major or elective subject and Hindi as medium of examination at degree level.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Work Experience</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">One year experience Of translation work from English to Hindi and viceversa of various reports/ Documents/ Letters in a bank/financial institution is Desirable.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Competency in operating computer is must. Candidate will be required to type /create the translated text documents on his / her own in MS word &amp; Excel in Hindi &amp; English.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exposure/ experience related to development of AI based tools for translation would be an added qualifications.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>IBPS Hindi Officer Online Form 2025 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Prelims Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mains Written Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Personal Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Apply IBPS Hindi Officer Recruitment 2025</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates can apply through link https://www.ibps.in/ or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the IBPS before Last Date.</sp